# Lines NoWayOS's tools/qemu-test must see, in this order: with the
# looper's budget widened to its period, the heartbeat beats until the looper
# starts after the third beat, and then stops - a fourth beat is forbidden,
# from then until the end of the settle period.
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: beating every 100 ms
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: beat 3: on time
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: looper: looping from now on

!MON|ERROR
!seL4(CPU
!panicked
!gave up
!beat 4:
